{ ============================================================
  ADAPTIVE FARMER - TREND LONG STRATEGY
  Signal Name : Strategy_TXF_60M_Breakout_B_ATR_V3_1_L1c
  MC Load Name: WILLY_ATR_LONG_60M
  Version     : V3.1 L1_c Primary SL + V3.0 Layer 0/2/3 preserved
  Symbol      : TXF1 (Taiwan Stock Index Futures Front Month)
