{ ==========================================
  0. P5 v3: Holiday Tail Registry (2019-2026)

  Holiday_Tail = the calendar date stamped on the 00:00-05:00
  tail bars of the LAST night session before each market
  closure. Always = last trading day + 1 calendar day
  (robust to closure length; Saturday tails are valid).

  Iron Rule: position must be 0 before that session's 05:00
  close. Tail bars block entries and force a market exit.

  Sources: TAIFEX official annual market calendars.
  - 2026 verified against the official 115-yr PDF (2026-06-12).
  - Entries marked * were MISSING from the old eve-based list
    (Labor Day every year; 2025 new statutory holidays) and are
    reconstructed; verify vs archived TAIFEX PDFs before
    trusting re-backtest stats on those windows.
  ========================================== }

